36, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc8c9c.jpg"}], "slug": "new-pokemon-snap", "storyline": "A budding Pok\u00e9mon photographer travels to the lush and varied Lental region, invited by the esteemed Professor Mirror and his assistant Rita to join their ecological research. Working from the Laboratory of Ecological and Natural Sciences, the player is sent out across the region's islands to observe and photograph Pok\u00e9mon thriving in their natural habitats, from jungles and deserts to reefs and caves. But the survey has a deeper purpose. The professor is investigating the mysterious Illumina phenomenon, a strange, glowing radiance that certain Pok\u00e9mon and rare flowers exhibit, a wonder last documented in an explorer's travelogue a full century ago. Venturing through each island by day and night, the photographer sets out to capture these elusive creatures on film and help unravel the long-forgotten secret behind the luminous phenomenon.", "summary": "New Pok\u00e9mon Snap is an on-rails first-person photography game developed by Bandai Namco Studios and published by Nintendo and The Pok\u00e9mon Company for the Nintendo Switch. It is a sequel to the 1999 Nintendo 64 game Pok\u00e9mon Snap. Players explore an archipelago in an autopilot hovercraft and photograph Pok\u00e9mon in order to conduct research about their ecology.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/new-pokemon-snap", "videos": [{"id": 37506, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "dYuNkNJUyeA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dYuNkNJUyeA", "title": "New Pokemon Snap - Official Switch Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/dYuNkNJUyeA/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 46069, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "8fdKOUa1Re0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8fdKOUa1Re0", "title": "Get the latest from the Lental region! #NewPokemonSnap \ud83d\udcf8", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/8fdKOUa1Re0/maxre